@startuml
left to right direction

rectangle "Player\n玩家" as Player
rectangle "Enemy\n敵人" as Enemy
rectangle "RayCast2D\n平台邊緣偵測" as RayCast
rectangle "Wall / TileMap\n平台與牆面" as World
rectangle "AnimatedSprite2D\n敵人朝向顯示" as EnemySprite

RayCast -[hidden]down-> Enemy
Enemy -[hidden]-> EnemySprite
World -[hidden]down-> Player

RayCast --> Enemy : a1 回報前方是否仍有地板
Enemy --> Enemy : a2 無地板時反轉 direction
Enemy --> EnemySprite : a3 _update_facing 更新朝向

World --> Enemy : b1 撞牆時 is_on_wall() 為 true
Enemy --> Enemy : b2 反轉 direction
Enemy --> EnemySprite : b3 _update_facing 更新朝向

Player --> World : c1 在平台上移動與跳躍

legend right
  |= Flow |= 說明 |
  | a | 巡邏時，因前方沒有地板而轉向 |
  | b | 巡邏時，因撞牆而轉向 |
  | c | 玩家與平台的基本移動關係 |
endlegend
@enduml
